      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1785385001,
      "updated": 1785385007
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6ad4cf0000000000d73b82",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1785386191,
      "updated": 1785386191
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6ad4cf0000000000d73b83",
      "text": "もともと[Netflixゲーム]であったが無料で再配信された",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1785386191,
      "updated": 1785386201
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63fa730000000000620c06",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784937076,
      "updated": 1784937076
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f8fd000000000062420d",
      "text": " なにこれむっず！[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936702,
      "updated": 1784936702
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f8fd000000000062420e",
      "text": " コツはありそう",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936702,
      "updated": 1784936702
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f9120000000000624213",
      "text": "  壁の跳ね返りを活かす",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936723,
      "updated": 1784936742
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f92a0000000000624215",
      "text": "  狙った軌道を描けるように空中ジャンプの始点を調整する",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936747,
      "updated": 1784936791
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f8fd000000000062420f",
      "text": "  落下中にフルーツを取る",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936702,
      "updated": 1784936800
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f8fd0000000000624210",
      "text": "  慣性キャンセルのために地面に向かって飛ぶ",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936702,
      "updated": 1784936702
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f8fd0000000000624211",
      "text": "  どうにもならないときは早めにキャンセルする",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936702,
      "updated": 1784936819
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6aa9ed0000000000da2ff7",
      "text": " パズルモードはフルーツ回収方法を学べるのでよい",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1785375214,
      "updated": 1785375240
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f8fd0000000000624212",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936702,
      "updated": 1784936702
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f9730000000000624216",
      "text": " ボーナスは意外とでかい[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936820,
      "updated": 1784936829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f97b0000000000624218",
      "text": "  序盤スキップに有効",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936828,
      "updated": 1784936838
    },
    {
      "id": "6a63f9740000000000624217",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1784936821,
      "updated": 1784936821
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6aaa0f0000000000da2ffb",
      "text": "アウタースペース",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1785375247,
      "updated": 1785375251
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6aaa130000000000da2ffd",
      "text": " 入って早々死んだ[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1785375252,
      "updated": 1785375270
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6aaa0f0000000000da2ffc",
      "text": "  足場がなくなるのが特徴",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1785375248,
      "updated": 1785375299
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7ee3210000000000b23b63",
      "text": "[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1786700579,
      "updated": 1786700587
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7ee3210000000000b23b64",
      "text": "エンドレスモード解禁",
